Seeds accept Python integers only: reject bool/float/string, extract i64 with overflow mapping, reject negative seed/zero stride. CPython integer seeding folds sign, so admitting −s and +s permits collisions. Pass admitted decimal text to `ObservationGame::from_seed`. Require positive n_envs/native_threads, checked size products, and an explicit pool even with one thread. `seed_state` explicitly constructs nested Python tuples, not automatic Vec→list conversion.

